        "id": 1074628
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-09-20T22:35:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was trying to keep the size of the assembly file down, while still being able to read it in a text editor (so more than a single line). With .quad, it\u0027s 2.1MB. Switching to .byte and decimal (to remove the 0x overhead), it\u0027s only 3MB, which seems reasonable still. And it\u0027s much simpler code.",
      "parentUuid": "601d3bce_57a2b53a",
